  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Vulnerable Individuals to Access the EU Settlement Scheme (EUSS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Organization for Migration (IOM) will work in partnership with Here for Good, and in close cooperation with a wide referral network of third sector organisations and Local Authority frontline teams, to deliver OISC Level 2+ advice and casework support to vulnerable or at-risk EU citizens and eligible family members, to support their applications to the EU Settlement Scheme (EUSS).</narrative>
  </description>
